  "description": "Introducing Bronco Slab, a bold western slab serif font with a rugged, vintage athletic personality. Built with chunky, heavy letterforms, strong block serifs, and softly rounded corners, this display typeface delivers maximum impact and instant readability, perfect for designs that need to stand out.\nBronco Slab blends the spirit of the Old West with classic varsity and sports lettering. Its all-caps uppercase design makes it ideal for headlines, logos, posters, apparel, and branding projects that call for a tough, authentic, retro look.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Introducing Bronco Slab, a bold western slab serif font with a rugged, vintage athletic personality. Built with chunky, heavy letterforms, strong block serifs, and softly rounded corners, this display typeface delivers maximum impact and instant readability, perfect for designs that need to stand out.</p>\n<p>Bronco Slab blends the spirit of the Old West with classic varsity and sports lettering. Its all-caps uppercase design makes it ideal for headlines, logos, posters, apparel, and branding projects that call for a tough, authentic, retro look.</p>",
